# Smart HandWritten Note Understanding Service

## Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your API keys.

```
# Server
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development

# MongoDB
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster.mongodb.net/smart-notes

# Groq AI
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Hugging Face (TrOCR)
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=your_huggingface_api_key_here

# Clerk (for backend token verification)
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=your_clerk_secret_key_here

# File Uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=10
UPLOAD_DIR=uploads

# ElevenLabs (optional audio)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_api_key_here

# Curriculum Knowledge Base (PostgreSQL)
CURRICULUM_DB_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://neondb_owner:npg_6qliOG7utYab@ep-twilight-mode-apd0prh5-pooler.c-7.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb

# Qdrant Vector Knowledge Base
QDRANT_DB_URL=http://localhost:6333
QDRANT_COLLECTION=pdf_knowledge_base
```

